            "review_title": "Review at VERA CAKES Đà Nẵng",
            "review_text": "Minh Alan\nDa Nang, Vietnam256 contributions\n0\nBirthday cake is really beautiful and delicious\nAug 2025 • Family\nI have bought cakes here many times because the flavor is very fragrant and the quality of the cake is very delicious, soft and fatty, melting in the mouth. The shop owner with name Huyen is very cheerful and warmly welcomes. The staff is also enthusiastic and smiling, welcoming attentively, advising on very beautiful cakes. Entering the shop, you can immediately smell the aroma of the cake. My wife and children had very interesting surprises from the cake with creativity according to my request. We had 2 most memorable birthday evenings with beautiful memories in the past time. Thank you very much Vera Cakes.\nRead more\nWritten November 1, 2025",
